00:01:28.829 --> 00:01:31.650
third layer. We could have a magic

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.540
hexagon- or we could try and get, a magic

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:36.600
hexagon of size 4, size 5 or something

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:40.049
else - they don't exist. This is the only

00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:42.750
magic hexagon, it is unique, 
