00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:14.860
n, n minus 1, plus 1. That's kind

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.150
of come out of nowhere; I can actually

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.830
show you why that's true, there's a nice

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.690
way to show you why that's true, which is

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.850
why I got the prop here. So I'm going to

