00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:42.850
like three rectangles here and each

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:47.440
rectangle is going to be n long and n

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:50.260
minus 1 on the short side. So long side

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.630
is n, the short side is n minus 1. So each

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:56.380
rectangle is n times n minus 1; there's

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.660
three of them so it's three lots of that

00:05:58.660 --> 00:05:59.830
